[ti:Toota Ghadaa Gaaye]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Aaj maine ajab tamaashaa dekha
[00:17.92]Baabaa aur do ghade sang khel
[00:27.85]Subah shaam wo ghade uthaave
[00:37.77]Paani bhare rojana kaam
[00:47.69]Toota ghada roya, aansu bahaaya
[00:57.62]Haye re mere baabaa
[01:07.54]Teri mehnat bekaar jaaye
[01:17.46]Tu roj bhaare, main roj giraaun
[01:27.39]Teri pyaas bhi na bujh paaye
[01:37.31]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[01:47.23]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[01:57.16]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[02:07.08]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[02:17.00]Tan par maans naam baraabar
[02:26.93]Kandhe jhoole janeu dhaagaa
[02:36.85]Main hoon toota, main hoon bekaar
[02:46.77]Mujhse kyun uthaaye baabaa?
[02:56.70]Tu dekhe jo phool raah mein khilte
[03:06.62]Hariyali chhaayi, mahak uthi hai
[03:16.54]Wo teri ek ek boond ka karishma
[03:26.47]Tu khud ko anjaan rakhti hai
[03:36.39]Tu roya to raah mein gul khile
[03:46.31]Tu chhalka to sabza mile
[03:56.24]Har qatra tera banta hai nadiya
[04:06.16]Phir kyon kahe tu jhootha ghada?
[04:16.09]Tu sachcha hai baabaa sachcha
[04:26.01]Do taar ka milan hai sachcha
[04:35.93]Toota toota nahi balki chhanne la
[04:45.86]Jo chhan gaya wohi peene la
[04:55.78]Lead: Main andha tha!
[05:05.70]Chorus: Andha tha!
[05:15.63]Lead: Apni darar ko rog samjha!
[05:25.55]Chorus: Rog samjha!
[05:35.47]Lead: Par teri nazar ne rang dikhaaya!
[05:45.40]Chorus: Rang dikhaaya!
[05:55.32]Lead: Mera wo chhed mera hi geet ban gaya!
[06:05.24]Chorus: Geet ban gaya!
[06:15.17]Toota ghada gaaye! Toota ghada gaaye!
[06:25.09]Baabaa bole – mat ro deewaane
[06:35.01]Jo lage vyarth wohi saphal hai
[06:44.94]Har boond mein saagar hai
[06:54.86]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[07:04.78]Aaj nahi to kal wapas!
[07:14.71]Kal wapas! Kal wapas!
[07:24.63]Nahi akaarth koi karm... Sab aaj nahi... to kal wapas... Jo ghada apni darar se gaaya
[07:34.55]Wohi saagar ke munh tak pahuncha
[07:44.48]Tu ro mat... tu ro mat... Tera chhalakna hi tera baabaa hai... Tak... tak... tak...
